WEBVTT

00:37.787 --> 00:41.958
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE

01:11.905 --> 01:12.822
Mrs. Nawol.

01:14.449 --> 01:16.117
- Mrs. Nawol.
- Yes?

01:17.577 --> 01:20.413
This letter. Who is it from?

01:21.289 --> 01:22.624
What is this?

01:23.374 --> 01:24.834
You didn't put it on my desk?

01:24.918 --> 01:25.919
No, I didn't.

01:27.462 --> 01:30.215
Beom-o. Did you take it upstairs?

01:30.298 --> 01:31.800
It wasn't me either.

01:32.675 --> 01:33.593
What's wrong?

01:34.177 --> 01:35.386
What does the letter say?

01:37.555 --> 01:38.389
Why?

01:38.473 --> 01:40.391
Does it say something bad?

01:42.644 --> 01:45.730
I'LL BE WAITING AT THE MOONLIGHT BAR

02:03.123 --> 02:05.208
You don't want to go in, Master Jang.

02:06.084 --> 02:07.085
It's her.

02:37.699 --> 02:38.825
You came.

02:41.119 --> 02:44.706
It's been, what,
two years since the war ended?

02:44.789 --> 02:46.958
I thought you had gone back to Japan.

02:47.750 --> 02:49.502
Not that I had died?

02:55.091 --> 02:58.344
Let's hear why you came to see me.
What do you want?

03:01.723 --> 03:03.808
I'd like to hear an apology first.

03:04.309 --> 03:06.978
You ruined my husband's funeral…

03:09.272 --> 03:10.773
and hurt me.

03:14.569 --> 03:18.239
We simply tried to mourn
those who died at Ongseong Hospital.

03:19.073 --> 03:23.745
Is that how you like to justify
the terrorist attack you committed?

03:25.997 --> 03:27.916
We call it resistance.

03:29.834 --> 03:32.086
I was true to you.

03:35.632 --> 03:39.135
I truly thought of you as a friend
and worried about you.

03:40.220 --> 03:41.638
And so I helped you.

03:42.222 --> 03:46.726
But you always repay me
with rejections and affronts.

03:50.396 --> 03:55.109
True friendship isn't about give-and-take
and paying each other back.

03:55.860 --> 03:58.947
It's about sharing
and understanding each other.

04:05.370 --> 04:07.830
Go back to your country now, Lady Maeda.

04:08.706 --> 04:11.459
The era of your people has come to an end.

04:14.087 --> 04:17.340
I hope we never see each other again.

04:49.455 --> 04:51.708
There is no place left for you

04:53.334 --> 04:54.335
to return to,

04:55.169 --> 04:56.587
Mr. Jang Tae-sang.

05:04.137 --> 05:05.388
Beom-o, quickly!

06:13.289 --> 06:14.207
Mr. Gu!

07:00.128 --> 07:01.295
Mrs. Nawol…

07:30.700 --> 07:33.786
Out of the way, you fucking bastards.

07:36.956 --> 07:37.874
Mrs. Nawol.

08:15.244 --> 08:18.414
I've given some thought
to what you said earlier.

08:19.916 --> 08:21.959
But I still disagree.

08:23.503 --> 08:29.300
Friends are meant to give and take
and pay each other back.

09:19.308 --> 09:20.226
Mrs. Nawol.

09:21.852 --> 09:22.687
Mrs. Nawol?

09:27.400 --> 09:30.236
Mrs. Nawol.

09:34.824 --> 09:37.410
Mrs. Nawol. Wake up.

09:38.327 --> 09:41.414
Mrs. Nawol. Look at me.

09:44.667 --> 09:46.085
Water.

09:47.503 --> 09:48.838
I need water.

10:16.699 --> 10:17.533
No.

10:18.534 --> 10:19.619
Mr. Gu.

10:19.702 --> 10:20.828
Beom-o!

10:22.747 --> 10:24.248
Mr. Gu!

10:30.713 --> 10:33.716
Mr. Gu!

10:35.885 --> 10:37.803
No!

10:39.221 --> 10:41.849
No! Please, no!

10:45.561 --> 10:47.521
You rotten sons of bitches!

11:33.901 --> 11:35.027
Master Jang.

11:45.329 --> 11:46.372
Sir…

11:49.875 --> 11:51.669
Are you all right?

11:53.587 --> 11:55.548
Are you all right, Mrs. Nawol?

11:57.049 --> 11:59.260
Are you hurt?

11:59.343 --> 12:02.179
I feel strange.

12:07.643 --> 12:08.894
It's so cold.

12:11.772 --> 12:13.107
And my head hurts.

12:17.653 --> 12:19.196
Can you help me?

12:25.703 --> 12:26.787
Mrs. Nawol.

12:30.624 --> 12:31.667
I'm coming.

13:07.745 --> 13:08.621
Mrs. Nawol.

13:11.123 --> 13:12.166
Tae-sang.

13:23.427 --> 13:24.428
Run.

13:27.932 --> 13:29.225
Now.

13:33.479 --> 13:34.480
Get away from me.

13:40.486 --> 13:42.029
It's all right, Tae-sang.

13:54.667 --> 13:55.584
I…

13:59.964 --> 14:01.048
I'm all right.

14:04.844 --> 14:05.803
You know…

14:09.431 --> 14:11.100
what I mean, don't you?

14:32.288 --> 14:36.208
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE
BETWEEN CURSE AND BLESSING

14:36.292 --> 14:40.212
EPISODE 5
THE CREATURE

14:53.767 --> 14:55.144
People often think

14:56.478 --> 15:01.817
they will find happiness
once they have everything.

15:03.944 --> 15:05.029
No.

15:05.613 --> 15:09.909
When you have everything, you get bored.

15:13.078 --> 15:17.708
You get bored
and become apathetic to everything.

15:25.007 --> 15:28.886
That's why you turn to destruction.

15:35.267 --> 15:38.187
Whenever I see fear and rage
in a person's eyes,

15:38.270 --> 15:41.065
I'm always able to grasp

15:42.608 --> 15:45.778
the fact that I am alive.

15:48.614 --> 15:50.157
Long time no see.

15:51.909 --> 15:53.494
Ms. Yoon Chae-ok.

15:56.747 --> 15:58.374
How are you…

16:00.334 --> 16:04.797
The same way you're still alive,
I presume.

16:14.598 --> 16:16.141
I'm not surprised.

16:19.645 --> 16:21.021
Was it Seishin?

16:26.944 --> 16:28.654
So much time has passed.

16:30.948 --> 16:36.120
But now that I face you again,
everything suddenly becomes very clear,

16:37.538 --> 16:39.164
as if it all happened yesterday.

16:42.292 --> 16:44.920
Memories of you, Seishin…

16:47.006 --> 16:48.382
and Mr. Jang.

16:50.759 --> 16:52.469
Why are you people…

16:55.347 --> 16:57.474
still here to this day?

16:59.685 --> 17:02.855
Why do you think we shouldn't be here?

17:04.648 --> 17:08.569
We are no longer
your enemies or perpetrators.

17:13.741 --> 17:15.701
Considering the time that has passed,

17:16.827 --> 17:20.789
shouldn't you be thanking us,
even just a little bit?

17:24.043 --> 17:26.170
You, Ms. Yoon Chae-ok,

17:26.837 --> 17:28.630
are still alive because of us.

17:30.424 --> 17:31.842
As is Mr. Jang.

17:41.769 --> 17:43.854
You experimented on him too?

17:47.399 --> 17:49.068
I simply did him a favor.

17:51.403 --> 17:52.321
As a friend.

17:59.119 --> 18:00.537
Why did you?

18:01.955 --> 18:03.415
Why did you do that?!

18:05.292 --> 18:09.922
Why did you have to bring him into this?!

18:12.758 --> 18:13.759
Do you know…

18:15.886 --> 18:19.681
why hell is a dreadful place,
by any chance?

18:25.354 --> 18:26.897
Because it never ends.

18:29.691 --> 18:31.235
He and I couldn't be friends,

18:33.028 --> 18:37.074
so I decided to become his hell instead.

19:02.599 --> 19:05.727
Why are you suddenly involving her
in the experiment?

19:09.273 --> 19:10.440
Why do you ask?

19:10.524 --> 19:14.528
To have constant variables
in an important plan is not ideal.

19:15.404 --> 19:18.574
It increases the chance
of unpredictable situations.

19:22.035 --> 19:23.787
This isn't about the experiment.

19:25.914 --> 19:28.750
I am exacting revenge on her…

19:30.752 --> 19:33.547
that I couldn't get 79 years ago.

20:04.411 --> 20:05.871
Master Jang.

20:19.343 --> 20:22.471
Master Jang!

20:27.935 --> 20:30.562
Are you okay? Master Jang!

20:38.987 --> 20:40.072
Make your choice now.

20:41.073 --> 20:43.075
Either go back to the man you used to be

20:44.076 --> 20:44.952
or…

20:47.204 --> 20:48.455
die here like this.

20:54.753 --> 20:55.754
What's your call?

20:56.755 --> 20:59.508
Do you want to go back or…

21:01.843 --> 21:03.762
let her watch you die?

21:08.850 --> 21:10.185
And if I go back…

21:14.815 --> 21:15.857
to how I was before…

21:20.445 --> 21:21.780
I can beat you?

21:24.116 --> 21:24.950
Maybe.

21:26.827 --> 21:29.121
And I can…

21:31.456 --> 21:33.041
save her too?

21:39.423 --> 21:40.257
Maybe.

21:46.305 --> 21:48.682
Don't try to do anything. Just stay there.

21:48.765 --> 21:50.767
I'll come to you now.

21:52.019 --> 21:54.313
Don't move. Just stay there!

21:54.396 --> 21:58.483
I'll head over there right now.

22:39.066 --> 22:41.234
No.

22:45.113 --> 22:47.574
No!

22:48.158 --> 22:52.245
No!

22:55.874 --> 22:57.209
No!

22:57.292 --> 22:59.169
You shouldn't!

23:05.550 --> 23:07.886
Don't do it. Stop!

23:11.098 --> 23:14.184
No, don't do it!

23:40.293 --> 23:42.504
No!

23:45.382 --> 23:46.466
No.

24:51.907 --> 24:53.533
I'm looking for someone.

24:56.828 --> 24:58.038
Cherry blossoms…

24:58.121 --> 25:00.040
Until the cherry blossoms fall.

25:01.875 --> 25:04.085
That was my mother.

25:09.925 --> 25:11.218
Let's make a promise.

25:11.301 --> 25:12.677
Stay alive.

25:12.761 --> 25:15.347
Do you really think
those good times will come to us?

25:15.430 --> 25:16.723
No!

25:20.435 --> 25:22.646
The cherry blossoms…

25:24.773 --> 25:26.441
have all fallen.

25:30.403 --> 25:31.446
Master Jang!

25:33.365 --> 25:34.407
Master Jang!

25:39.913 --> 25:41.998
I need to go to him.

25:42.082 --> 25:43.333
It's too late.

25:44.709 --> 25:46.753
There's nothing you can do now.

25:57.430 --> 25:58.640
Stop her!

27:14.382 --> 27:15.592
Yoon Chae-ok.

27:19.387 --> 27:20.472
Where is she?

28:26.746 --> 28:28.248
Jang Ho-jae has escaped.

28:34.462 --> 28:36.715
It seems our fears have been realized.

28:40.885 --> 28:43.763
Jang Tae-sang is out of control
and looking for the woman.

28:47.809 --> 28:48.893
Go…

28:51.187 --> 28:52.439
and bring him to me.

28:55.692 --> 28:56.943
What about the woman?

29:03.992 --> 29:05.160
Kill her.

29:07.454 --> 29:08.872
Very well, ma'am.

29:32.645 --> 29:34.814
You've gotta be kidding me.

29:58.254 --> 29:59.255
Who are you?

30:00.507 --> 30:02.008
And who are you?

30:02.675 --> 30:04.093
I asked you first!

30:04.177 --> 30:08.139
I'm a good friend
of the owners who live here.

30:08.223 --> 30:11.267
I come by and share my side dishes
and kimchi with them.

30:11.351 --> 30:14.270
What about you? How do you know them?

30:15.814 --> 30:18.900
I'm not as close to them as you are.

30:21.361 --> 30:23.029
Why did you make a hole in the wall?

30:23.863 --> 30:26.533
Wait, I didn't do that.

30:26.616 --> 30:29.118
Let's see.
What was the number for the police?

30:29.202 --> 30:32.163
There's no need. I am the police.

30:32.705 --> 30:35.041
Detective Noh Ji-su
from Jongno Police Station.

30:35.124 --> 30:37.001
I'm here to pursue a suspect.

30:37.085 --> 30:38.169
A suspect?

30:38.920 --> 30:40.088
Who's a suspect?

30:40.171 --> 30:42.257
Well, Mr. Jang Ho-jae.

30:44.592 --> 30:46.553
It always makes me wonder.

30:47.136 --> 30:51.808
Why do cops leave the real culprits alone
and harass the innocent all the time?

30:51.891 --> 30:53.226
Excuse me, ma'am--

30:53.309 --> 30:54.143
Enough.

30:54.811 --> 30:55.645
Make a call.

30:55.728 --> 30:56.646
Pardon?

30:56.729 --> 30:58.648
Call your captain right now.

30:58.731 --> 31:01.484
You want me to call my captain? Why?

31:01.568 --> 31:02.902
Should I call him, then?

31:11.786 --> 31:12.954
Detective Noh.

31:13.037 --> 31:16.374
Myung-jun, is that you?
It's me, Antenna from Sinseol-dong.

31:17.500 --> 31:19.419
Ma'am, what's going on?

31:19.502 --> 31:21.254
I'm calling about Master Jang.

31:22.005 --> 31:24.591
Where are you?
Are you gonna make me come to you?

31:29.846 --> 31:30.972
Tell me where you are.

31:32.724 --> 31:34.058
You lost her?

31:34.142 --> 31:35.435
I apologize.

31:35.518 --> 31:38.605
You know, you build up tolerance
when you catch a cold.

31:38.688 --> 31:41.399
She was hit with nitrogen once.
She won't fall for it again.

31:42.483 --> 31:46.070
You know that no one can handle Ho-jae
when he flips out.

31:47.572 --> 31:51.576
You're probably the only person
who has a chance of stopping him now.

31:51.659 --> 31:53.119
Or, you know,

31:54.203 --> 31:55.538
release the kid downstairs.

31:56.581 --> 31:58.333
Number 71, was it?

31:58.416 --> 32:00.084
He must be in his best shape.

32:05.340 --> 32:07.425
- Release the Kurokos.
- Yes, sir.

32:38.998 --> 32:40.083
No!

32:48.800 --> 32:49.884
Where is she?

32:51.469 --> 32:52.679
Tell me where she is.

32:54.472 --> 32:56.224
Where is she?!

33:51.279 --> 33:52.655
I don't remember when,

33:53.698 --> 33:55.533
but everything started to fade away.

33:57.243 --> 34:00.121
Why I'd been fighting,
what I'd been fighting for,

34:01.080 --> 34:02.832
and even my rage.

34:10.298 --> 34:12.800
I couldn't overcome a certain yearning.

34:34.030 --> 34:35.531
I existed…

34:37.658 --> 34:39.452
but I wasn't living.

34:44.665 --> 34:47.585
All I wanted was to see her.

35:02.517 --> 35:03.976
I wanted to embrace her…

35:05.937 --> 35:09.148
and hold on to her.

35:19.742 --> 35:20.618
Master Jang!

35:20.701 --> 35:22.453
Just once would be enough

35:23.788 --> 35:25.331
if it meant I could see you.

36:03.661 --> 36:04.495
If it meant

36:05.913 --> 36:07.206
I could touch you.

36:23.222 --> 36:24.599
Master Jang.

36:36.944 --> 36:38.154
It's me.

36:43.910 --> 36:46.037
I'm here.

37:55.106 --> 37:55.982
What happened?

37:56.065 --> 37:58.025
Two Kuroko units have been annihilated.

38:14.500 --> 38:16.043
What happened here?

38:16.127 --> 38:19.714
As you can see, they were totally crushed.

38:20.548 --> 38:22.383
And I got destroyed.

38:22.967 --> 38:25.761
- Where's Jang Tae-sang?
- He ran away with the woman.

38:26.595 --> 38:28.639
They were heading toward tunnel 5.

38:29.598 --> 38:32.268
What, you want me to go after them?

38:33.060 --> 38:35.354
Pursue them now. Don't let them escape.

38:35.980 --> 38:36.814
Yes, sir.

39:44.548 --> 39:45.591
There's no time.

39:46.300 --> 39:48.135
The Kurokos will be swarming again.

39:48.219 --> 39:49.136
Can you

39:50.679 --> 39:52.014
take care of her?

39:54.683 --> 39:58.145
In this state, she won't get far
before being captured by the Kurokos.

39:58.938 --> 40:02.858
I'll try to distract them the best I can.
Please get her out of here.

40:03.984 --> 40:05.444
Can you do that for me?

40:07.279 --> 40:08.447
Please, Seung-jo.

40:12.868 --> 40:13.786
Remember tunnel 5?

40:15.079 --> 40:18.958
Take a right at the end of this hallway.
There's a small hole in the ceiling.

40:19.041 --> 40:20.835
It's not noticeable. You might pass it.

40:22.670 --> 40:23.671
So keep an eye out.

40:28.467 --> 40:29.844
It will be all right.

40:30.970 --> 40:32.054
I'll see you outside.

41:20.269 --> 41:22.062
Did he not come this way?

41:24.106 --> 41:26.150
But this is the only exit.

41:40.873 --> 41:42.166
Bring Seung-jo to me.

42:01.852 --> 42:05.147
It looks like you found it right away
without missing it.

42:08.400 --> 42:10.069
She should be in front of exit 5.

42:11.654 --> 42:14.573
If you go out like that,
people will notice you in no time.

42:16.200 --> 42:17.117
Get changed.

42:27.586 --> 42:28.629
Thanks, Seung-jo.

42:29.213 --> 42:31.966
Please.
I told you not to pat me on the head.

42:33.133 --> 42:34.385
I'm not a kid anymore.

42:34.885 --> 42:38.347
I'll get going. They'll suspect me
if I'm gone for too long.

42:44.937 --> 42:46.313
That day, a year ago…

42:49.733 --> 42:51.193
I'm sorry I couldn't make it.

42:52.611 --> 42:53.487
Bro.
